<SNAP stateVersion="2" order="shift,space,press,drive" name="floor breathes with you" tags="Warm,Punchy,Drum Bus,Loop,Glue" description="makes four-on-the-floor grooves breathe: a ducked attic room feeds single-band glue so the kick gently pumps the hats and claps, with tape warmth and slightly scooped mids.">
